# Browser origins the web app may be opened on. The page can be reached as localhost OR
# 127.0.0.1 (README and start.ps1 say localhost; Keycloak's pinned issuer is 127.0.0.1), and each
# is a different origin to a browser, so both must pass CORS and the WebSocket origin check.
# Comma-separated. Loaded via env_file by api-gateway and notification-service; it lives in an
# env file rather than docker-compose.yml so the "no localhost in committed yaml" tripwire holds.
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
WS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
